## Layout

| Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `src/lib.rs` | Library crate: all logic lives here so it is easy to test |
| `src/main.rs` | Thin binary: argument handling and output |
| `tests/` | Integration tests that run the compiled binary |
| `rustfmt.toml` | Formatting config |
| `docs/` | Documentation and ADRs |

## Decisions

Record significant decisions as short ADRs in `docs/adr/` (one file per decision).
